{{also|milk toast}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From the character {{w|Caspar Milquetoast}} of the comic strip ''The Timid Soul'', created by {{w|H._T._Webster|Harold Webster}} and first published in 1924 (named after the American dish {{m|en|milk toast}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/ˈmɪlktəʊst/|lang=en}}
* {{a|GenAm}} {{IPA|/ˈmɪlktoʊst/|lang=en}}

